[{"title":"江村即事","author":"高启","text":"野岸江村雨熟梅，水平风软燕飞回。\n小舟送饷荷包饭，远旆招沽竹酝醅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶睡","author":"高启","text":"竹间门掩似僧居，白豆花开片雨余。\n一榻茶烟成偶睡，觉来犹把读残书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟归江上过斜塘","author":"高启","text":"漫漫村塘水没沙，清明初过已无花。\n春寒欲雨归心急，懒住扁舟问酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西斋庭前海棠","author":"高启","text":"寂寥银烛与金盘，睡足帘前怯晓寒。\n不是诗人赏幽兴，雨中深院有谁看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次张仲和春日漫兴","author":"高启","text":"苏小坟前柳似烟，秋千人静夕阳天。\n独骑款段寻诗去，懒逐看花众少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与内弟周思敬晚过雁荡僧舍","author":"高启","text":"同过溪桥日欲晡，远林残叶似栖乌。\n照公院里堪留宿，已有梅花有酒无？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白傅湓浦图","author":"高启","text":"相逢沦落总天涯，舟泊湓江近荻花。\n逐客青衫自多泪，伤心不用怨瑟琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜闻女病（时在钱塘）","author":"高启","text":"岁尽归期尚杳然，不知汝病复谁怜。\n隔邻儿女灯前笑，客舍愁中正独眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江晚渡图","author":"高启","text":"鹧鸪飞尽一洲绩，帆带秋云度远津。\n底事愁看画中景，昨朝曾送渡江人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜中有感二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"少壮无欢似老时，身穷宁坐苦吟诗。\n卧思三十年来事，一半间关在乱离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜中有感二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"倦仆厨中睡已安，吹灯呼起冒霜寒。\n酒醒无限悲歌意，不觅书看觅剑看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过北塘道中四首 其一","author":"高启","text":"未得看春愁不禁，此日聊复试幽寻。\n行人入村花宛宛，吠犬隔水树深深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过北塘道中四首 其二","author":"高启","text":"春水满田如一湖，入田放艇看鹅雏。\n女郎祠下野花杂，老子门前沙树孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过北塘道中四首 其三","author":"高启","text":"若欲看春春色稀，乱后何处有芳菲。\n晚莺啼歇野寂寂，双树溪边人独归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过北塘道中四首 其四","author":"高启","text":"渺渺一径两陂间，杨柳初发水潺缓。\n惊鱼忽散人影尽，啼鸟时来春意闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17080,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨江馆写怀二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"愁解寻人不得辞，小窗疏竹雨来时。\n江湖今夜全家客，犹胜飘零两处思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17081,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨江馆写怀二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"漠漠春寒水绕村，有愁无酒不开门。\n青灯画角黄昏雨，客共梅花并断魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17082,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金征士玟雨中见过留宿二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"夜窗同听雨中猿，风物凄凉异故园。\n旧事堪愁今懒说，相看不是解忘言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金征士玟雨中见过留宿二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"莫辞同宿掩书帏，乱后萧条故旧稀。\n预恐明朝风雨歇，满江春水送君归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过流通院二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"僧懒开门见客迟，空林流水日斜时。\n欲留诗句知曾过，我后来看竟是谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过流通院二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"橘柚林中薜荔垣，幽寻几度入秋园。\n虽然老衲无闻见，犹胜相逢俗客言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17086,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送丁孝廉之钱塘就简张著作方员外","author":"高启","text":"江边同客乱离余，远别那堪近岁除。\n若见故人询旅况，知君解说不烦书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17087,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游幻住精舍","author":"高启","text":"寒扉斜向竹间推，此日重来是几回。\n行遍空林僧不见，慰人怜有一株梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17088,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效香奁二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"青琐初空别恨长，绣茸留得唾痕香。\n帘前月出无人拜，只有秋千影过墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17089,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效香奁二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"开过东窗百叶桃，瑟琶尘满缕金槽。\n欲呼小字敲妆阁，谁出相迎放剪刀？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17090,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上逢旧妓李氏见过四首 其一","author":"高启","text":"玉筝红烛艳春罗，惯向高堂听汝歌。\n今夕相逢为重唱，孤舟江冷月明多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17091,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上逢旧妓李氏见过四首 其二","author":"高启","text":"多谢停舟共一卮，石州歌罢各低眉。\n南园旧日同听客，零落如今剩有谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17092,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上逢旧妓李氏见过四首 其三","author":"高启","text":"谁识能歌旧散声，愁中听处尚分明。\n玲珑酒罢休催去，月落江潮尚未平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17093,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上逢旧妓李氏见过四首 其四","author":"高启","text":"平常歌舞不能闲，多在青春甲第间。\n借问年来还到否，朱门风雨几家关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17094,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月八日对菊","author":"高启","text":"预向离边把一杯，黄花多意已能开。\n不忧风雨明朝阻，懒逐时人斗折来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17095,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟行晚过张林","author":"高启","text":"望山几欲去寻幽，此日虽来不暇游。\n一棹黄昏过山下，疏灯络纬满林秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17096,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送叶山人","author":"高启","text":"岁晚麻衣冒雪寒，高歌欲去醉长安。\n山瓢行负知何有，半是诗丸半药丸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17097,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看梅漫成三首 其一","author":"高启","text":"江草初生江水流，便觉春色恼人愁。\n雪晴家家扣门去，不见梅花应不休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17098,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看梅漫成三首 其二","author":"高启","text":"江边寺里一梅树，几度劳人相候开。\n无情今日未肯发，有兴明朝还看来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17099,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看梅漫成三首 其三","author":"高启","text":"野人不省爱梅好，弃在荒篱荆棘边。\n细雨东风欲零落，我来相见一潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜至阳城田家","author":"高启","text":"东津渡头初月辉，南陵寺里远钟微。\n主人入夜门未掩，蒲响满塘鹅鸭归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村乐四首 其一","author":"高启","text":"荷浦张弓射鸭，柳塘持烛叉鱼。\n天随子宅同里，陶朱公祠近居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村乐四首 其二","author":"高启","text":"一犬行随饷榼，群蛾飞绕缲车。\n江边女去摘芡，城里人来卖茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村乐四首 其三","author":"高启","text":"罾挂渔郎舍外，船维酒媪桥边。\n烟波五湖朝渡，风雨孤村昼眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17104,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村乐四首 其四","author":"高启","text":"日斜深坞牛卧，潮落平沙蟹行。\n秋社未开绿酝，夜炊初碓红粳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17105,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读道旁旧家碣上题曰宋黄澹翁先生之墓","author":"高启","text":"古路斜阳废城，断碑荒草残茔。\n莫嗔童竖樵牧，不识先生姓名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17106,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨氏山庄","author":"高启","text":"斜阳流水几里，啼鸟空林一家。\n客去诗题柿叶，僧来供煮藤花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17107,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陶秘书广陵送别图","author":"高启","text":"暮雨潮生瓜步，春山树绕芜城。\n惆怅离舟欲发，江南烟寺钟声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17108,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐府杂曲 鼓吹曲辞 上之回","author":"高启","text":"圣主重行幸，六虬法乾旋。\n北巡初避暑，东祠已祈年。\n群官从清尘，粲若星丽天。\n前扬豹尾竿，左靡鱼须旃。\n瀚海通汉月，萧关绝胡烟。\n愿奉千龄乐，皇躬长泰然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17109,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李夫人歌","author":"高启","text":"延年罢歌少翁望，兰芬凄凄销复帐。\n临殁最难忘，欷歔不相向。\n陈杯觞，列灯火。\n是耶非，幄中坐。\n新宫漏残星欲堕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17110,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行","author":"高启","text":"置酒高台，乐极哀来。\n人生处世，能几何哉。\n日西月东，百龄易终。\n可嗟仲尼，不见周公。\n鼓丝拊石，以永今日。\n欢以别亏，忧因会释。\n燕鸿载鸣，兰无故荣。\n子如不乐，白发其盈。\n执子之手，以酌我酒。\n式咏《短歌》，爰祝长寿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17111,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛转行","author":"高启","text":"宛转复宛转，宛转日几回。\n君肠鹿卢断，我肠车轮摧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17112,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"高启","text":"憎宠一时心，尘生旧屋金。\n苔滋销履迹，花远度銮音。\n暮雀重门迥，秋萤别殿阴。\n君明犹不察，妒极是情深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17113,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"高启","text":"日落五原塞，萧条亭堠空。\n汉家讨狂虏，籍役满山东。\n去年出飞狐，今年出云中。\n得地不足耕，杀人以为功。\n登高望衰草，感叹意何穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17114,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳歌词二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"高枝拂翠幰，低枝垂绮筵。\n春风千万树，此树妾门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17115,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳歌词二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"江头横吹悲，北客休南去。\n闻道武昌门，愁人无别树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17116,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将进酒","author":"高启","text":"君不见陈孟公，一生爱酒称豪雄。\n君不见扬子云，三世执戟徒工文。\n得失如今两何有，劝君相逢且相寿。\n试看六印尽垂腰，何似一卮长在手。\n莫惜黄金醉青春，几人不饮身亦贫。\n酒中有趣世不识，但好富贵亡其真。\n便须吐车茵，莫畏丞相嗔。\n桃花满溪口，笑杀醒游人。\n丝绳玉缸酿初熟，摇荡春光若波绿。\n前无御史可尽欢，倒著锦袍舞鸊鹆。\n爱妾已去曲池平，此时欲饮焉能倾。\n地下应无酒垆处，何苦寂寞孤平生。\n一杯一曲，我歌君续。\n明月自来，不须秉烛。\n五岳既远，三山亦空。\n欲求神仙，在杯酒中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17117,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗敷行","author":"高启","text":"陌上三月时，柔桑多绿枝。\n携筐行采叶，日暮畏蚕饥。\n君来驻车马，相逢在桑下。\n谩说同心言，不是知音者。\n君贵多辉光，妾贱无红妆。\n自信田间妇，难从天上郎。\n长安画楼宇，无限如花女。\n使君当早归，莫共罗敷语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17118,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"当垆曲","author":"高启","text":"光艳动春朝，妆成映洛桥。\n钱多自解数，筝涩未能调。\n花如秦苑好，酒比蜀都饶。\n深谢诸年少，来沽不待要。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17119,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古词","author":"高启","text":"妾刀不断机，郎行当早归。\n还将机中锦，作郎身上衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17120,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌夜啼","author":"高启","text":"啼乌惊多栖未久，半起疏桐上高柳。\n灯下佳人颦浅眉，机中少妇停纤手。\n月入空闺夜欲深，数声犹似听君琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17121,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"堂上歌行","author":"高启","text":"堂上歌，歌南山，主人为欢仰客颜。\n翠帷夜卷出两鬟，移尊更饮花树间。\n花树间，有明月。\n客不醉，歌不歇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17122,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陇头水","author":"高启","text":"人间何处无流水，偏到陇头愁入耳。\n夜杂羌歌明月中，秋惊汉梦空山里。\n陇阪崎岖九回折，声随到处长呜咽。\n欲照愁颜畏水浑，前军曾洗金创血。\n回头千里是长安，征人泪枯流不干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17123,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"官侍长杨拜夕郎，况凭内宠在椒房。\n赐金十万身无用，乞作胡姬一日妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17124,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"下直平明出禁门，笑提博局伴王孙。\n宝刀不敢将输却，明日沙场欲报恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17125,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行","author":"高启","text":"沽酒渭桥边，平陵侠少年。\n相逢各有赠，宝剑与金鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17126,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妾薄命","author":"高启","text":"寂寞复寂寞，秋风吹罗幕。\n玉阶有微霜，桂树花已落。\n昔为卷衣女，承欢在瑶阁。\n弃鱼感泪多，当熊惭力弱。\n宁知色易老，难求黄金药。\n宫深去天远，忧思将何托？\n君恩非不深，妾命自轻薄。\n微躯愿有报，和亲死沙漠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17127,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结客少年场行","author":"高启","text":"结客须结游侠儿，借身报仇心不疑。\n千金买得利匕首，摩挲誓许酬相知。\n白马缦胡缨，行行人尽止。\n朝游洛北门，暮醉秦东市。\n感君在一言，不惜为君死。\n朱家曾脱季将军，田光终酬燕太子。\n君不见魏其盛时客满门，自言一一俱衔恩。\n魏其既罢谁复见，养士堂中尘网遍。\n始知结客难，徒言意气倾南山。\n食君之禄有弗报，何况区区杯酒间。\n结客不必皆荐绅，缓急叩门谁可亲。\n屠沽往往有奇士，慎勿相轻闾里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17128,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"君马黄","author":"高启","text":"君马黄，我马玄。\n君马金匼匝，我马锦连乾。\n两马喜遇皆嘶鸣，何异主人相见情。\n长安大道可并辔，莫夸得意争先行。\n摇鞭共踏落花去，燕姬酒垆在何处？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17129,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"高启","text":"杨白花，太轻薄。\n不向宫中飞，却度江南落。\n美人踏踏连臂歌，山长水阔奈尔何。\n奈尔何，春欲晚，何不飞去仍飞返。\n洛阳树，多啼鸦。\n愁杀人，杨白花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17130,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"门有车马客行","author":"高启","text":"门有车马客，乃是故乡士。\n昔别各壮颜，今见不相似。\n上堂叙情亲，拜跪出妻子。\n对案未能食，历历问桑梓。\n当时同游人，十有八九死。\n松柏长新坟，荆棘生故址。\n欢言方未终，悲感还复始。\n因思兴谢端，叹息不能止。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17131,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"擢歌行","author":"高启","text":"溶漾汉潭清，搴荷趁浪平。\n船轻知体弱，簪滑见鬟倾。\n落日悬江思，浮云结浦情。\n去从千叶隐，归爱一花迎。\n吴歈并《子夜》，谁似棹歌声？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17132,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣歌","author":"高启","text":"北斗城头北斗低，万家梦破一声鸡。\n马蹄踏踏车辘辘，阙下连趋市中逐。\n雄鸡安得噤尔声，利名少息世上争，漫漫夜长人不惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17133,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征妇怨","author":"高启","text":"良人不愿封侯印，虎符远发当番阵。\n几夜春闺恶梦多，竟得将军军覆信。\n身没犹存旧战衣，东家火伴为收归。\n妾生不识边庭路，寻骨何由到武威。\n纸幡剪得招魂去，只向当时送行处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17134,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄阳乐","author":"高启","text":"门前黄柳鸦雏宿，罗幌低垂婢擎烛。\n悬珰结佩略妆成，日莫相邀汉江曲。\n水静花寒月小明，舟中楼上斗歌声。\n肠断年年大堤路，南商行过北商行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17135,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮酒乐","author":"高启","text":"七弦五弦角奏，一觞两觞羽行。\n且乐眼中人聚，莫忧头上天倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17136,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道","author":"高启","text":"长乐钟声动，平津树色开。\n中郎长戟卫，丞相小车来。\n新成赐将第，更筑候神台。\n谁念公车客，空怀作赋才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17137,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]